### Connectify

### Overview

Connectify is a real-time chat application built for seamless communication between individuals and groups. It provides instant messaging, temporary status sharing, video calling, user management, and real-time notifications through a modern, secure, and scalable architecture. 

### Core Features

### Real-Time Communication

* Instant text messaging between users.
* Support for sharing images, videos, and files.
* Read receipts for message status.
* Persistent chat history.

### Status Updates

* Share updates using text, images, or videos.
* Configure status visibility using privacy settings.
* Automatically remove status updates after 24 hours.

### Video Calls

* High-quality audio and video communication powered by WebRTC.
* Supports both one-to-one and group calls.
* Provides controls for: 

  * Muting and unmuting the microphone.
  * Turning the camera on or off.
  * Ending an active call.

### User Management

* Secure user registration and authentication using JWT.
* Customizable profiles with profile images and bios.
* Contact synchronization.
* Group creation and management.

### Notifications

* Push notifications for new messages.
* Notifications for incoming calls.
* Alerts for new status updates.

### Performance and Scalability

Connectify is designed to support a large number of concurrent users while maintaining efficient real-time communication. 

* WebSocket connections for live updates.
* Efficient real-time message and event delivery.
* Scalable architecture for handling increased user activity.

### Communication Support

The application supports both individual and group-based communication, making it suitable for personal and professional use.
